cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Visole: RGB video to a pressure-graded lattice insole"
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end computational chain from ordinary walking video to a
  3D-printable, locally graded lattice insole, together with the measurements of
  how far each link holds. Includes a leave-one-subject-out evaluation of
  video-predicted plantar loading and a spatial-resolution ladder showing that
  the medial-lateral axis is not resolved.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Pigtot
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/"
keywords:
  - biomechanics
  - plantar pressure
  - gait analysis
  - pose estimation
  - lattice structures
  - 3D printing
  - insole
references:
  - type: data
    title: >-
